          <section class="case-text-block" aria-label="Schrift Shop product templates">
            <div class="type-body-lg case-prose">
              <p>Product templates separate story from commerce facts: narrative modules stack above purchase panels anchored with ISBN or SKU, dimensions, shipping notes, and edition limits when relevant.</p>
              <p>Variant selectors rely on typographic contrast instead of loud chrome — emphasis lands on names of cuts or papers, not on button skins.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

          <section class="schrift-shop-media-grid" aria-label="Schrift Shop product detail visuals">
            <figure class="schrift-shop-media schrift-shop-media--02" data-reveal="scale">
