          <section class="case-text-block" aria-label="Schrift Shop editorial commerce">
            <div class="type-body-lg case-prose">
              <p>Promotional strips reuse specimen motifs — oversized punctuation, cropped paragraphs, marginal notes — before yielding to transactional rails. That sequencing keeps campaigns aligned with essays readers already recognise from the journal.</p>
              <p>Where automation inserts merchandising slots, spacing stays generous so automated tiles cannot collapse into bargain-market rhythm.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

