          <section class="case-text-block" aria-label="Schrift Shop operations">
            <div class="type-body-lg case-prose">
              <p>Fulfilment and policy screens inherit the same grid as storytelling modules — legal blocks align to readable columns instead of boilerplate dumps.</p>
              <p>The outcome is a shop that reads like Schrift even when customers pause on invoices or returns — continuity matters because trust accumulates quietly.</p>
            </div>
          </section>

