          <section class="case-text-block" aria-label="Schrift Shop reflection">
            <div class="type-heading-lg case-lead-prose">
              <p>Schrift Shop closes the loop between research-grade typography and readers who still want ink on paper — commerce stays disciplined so the collective’s voice stays legible.</p>
              <p>Shipped surfaces anticipate ongoing catalogue growth: modular rails accept new specimens without redesigning checkout each season.</p>
